   "title": "Small corpus",
   "text": "0.9 million words, versus hundreds of millions for the main languages. Frequency values are unreliable, so there are no frequency bands, only the all-words generators. The reference lexicon has 124,408 words, so generators, neighbourhood measures and cluster filters are rougher than for the main languages."
