  {
   "title": "Newspaper vocabulary added",
   "text": "84,219 of the reference words come from a newspaper corpus (Leipzig Corpora Collection, bel_newscrawl_2015_1M, 17.1 million words); 40,189 come from the subtitle list. Written sources are more formal than subtitles and contain more names and foreign words. Frequencies of the corpus-only words come from that corpus and are not comparable with subtitle frequencies."
  }
